 R←Test_ListRepos_041(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;stop;plain;verbose
⍝ Regression test: -issues without -verbose must default to the issue count as sort order,
⍝ as the help promises. It used to fall back to the repo name.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 stop←0
 (rc msg plain)←stop UCMD'ListRepos ''aplteam'' -issues'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 (rc msg verbose)←stop UCMD'ListRepos ''aplteam'' -verbose -issues'
 →T.PassesIf rc=0
 →T.PassesIf(2↓plain[;1])≡¯2↓2↓verbose[;1]

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
